{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Taihe's Crazy Farm</i> is a fast-paced 2D action roguelite game. Players take on the role of a bee to dive deep into a cursed farm, challenging a variety of mutated bosses and mutated farm animals\u2014ranging from mutated creatures like chickens and bats to bosses such as zombie wild boars. Each boss features a unique two-phase combat mechanism: from the butcher wielding a kitchen knife to the spiked wild boar zombie, players can unleash gorgeous combos with simple controls and fight to survive amid the gory, blood-splattered battles!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816860/extras/1b44bc4c44adbb0e2c319eb023653e93.avif?t=1762048612\" width=794 height=638 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816860/extras/8c1a2d7f34e670001adf5f2d9151a079.poster.avif?t=1762048612\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816860/extras/8c1a2d7f34e670001adf5f2d9151a079.webm?t=1762048612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816860/extras/8c1a2d7f34e670001adf5f2d9151a079.mp4?t=1762048612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816860?t=1762048612","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816860/8fdd48b8e4112cfc4f6a773fdffbe6f5d4cd8f4d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762048612","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816860/2deda062d72a05174d49c9313b55e08849f09b57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762048612","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816860/2deda062d72a05174d49c9313b55e08849f0